<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tomkins upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tomkins upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston upgraded Tomkins Plc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tomkins gained 3/8 to 17-1/2 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
